DESCRIPTION:How is AI reshaping the future of health discovery\, education
 \, and care at Duke?\n\n  At this year's State of the School address\, De
 an Mary Klotman will explore how our community is harnessing artificial i
 ntelligence to accelerate discovery\, enhance education\, improve patient
  care\, and strengthen partnerships\, all while keeping our people at the
  center of everything we do.
