DESCRIPTION:Reading scientific literature can feel overwhelming when you'r
 e first getting started. In this workshop\, you'll learn practical strate
 gies for breaking down research articles\, identifying key takeaways\, an
 d understanding methods\, results\, and conclusions. Whether you're new t
 o academic research or looking to sharpen your skills\, this session will
  help you read more efficiently and critically engage with the literature
 .
DURATION:PT1H30M
